Lichtzentrale

This product includes software derived from hass-scene_presets by Hypfer:
https://github.com/Hypfer/hass-scene_presets
Upstream revision: b53280c76f6a94ea68f313c53865c3922d40b2d7
License: Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

The configuration flow, integration setup, panel registration, WebSocket setup,
capability-aware palette application, color-temperature approximation, React
custom-element bridge and webpack build are adapted from the upstream project.
Changed source files are marked "Geändert für Lichtzentrale".

The upstream presets, preset names, photos, logos and custom icon assets are not
included. Lichtzentrale's twelve palette names, color combinations and generated
gradient previews are original. Dynamic scenes and upstream custom-preset file
handling are deliberately not imported in stage 0.

The frontend includes React, React DOM and Scheduler (MIT). Their complete
license texts and extracted bundle notices are distributed in
custom_components/lichtzentrale/frontend/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt and
custom_components/lichtzentrale/frontend/lichtzentrale_panel.js.LICENSE.txt.
